# Vercel builds only the Next.js site. The FastAPI backend in api/ runs on the
# droplet, and a Python project file there made Vercel try to build it.
#
# Anchored with a leading slash: without it, "api/" also matched src/app/api/,
# so Vercel left out the site's own API routes (bank list, account-name lookup,
# Paystack status) and every one of them answered 404.
/api/
